<title>USA: Bettendorf, Iowa, Ser 97B won by Piper Jaffray.</title>
<headline>Bettendorf, Iowa, Ser 97B won by Piper Jaffray.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray Inc., said it won $1.310 million of Bettendorf, Iowa, general obligation refunding bonds, Series 1997 B, with a true interest cost of 4.60 percent.</p>
</text>
